<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Liang Shing shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Liang Shing shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of sport shoe maker Liang Shing (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong sotck exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Liang Shing shares closed unchanged at HK$0.28 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
